  "Text": "In July 2024 TxDOT awarded a $581 million contract to rebuild the freeway from Town East Blvd eastward to Belt Line Road, including demolishing and rebuilding the interchange at I-635. Previously in June 2022, TxDOT awarded a $129 million contract to rebuild US 80 at the Trinity River East Fork crossing, west of Forney between Lawson Road and Clements Drive. <br /><br />Long term plans include rebuilding and widening all remaining original freeway sections between Interstate 30 in Dallas and Lawson Road.",
